Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.30,0:00:03.40,Hero,,0,0,0,,MEETINGS ARE FINE.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.40,0:00:06.30,Subhero,,0,0,0,,Everyone is invited. Getting a word in is optional.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.30,0:00:07.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Every Monday at nine, Mina's team performed a beloved corporate ritual:\Npretending the meeting was fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.50,0:00:13.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ken had already spoken for twelve minutes. Yuki had three useful thoughts\Nand exactly zero safe openings.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.00,0:00:19.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rob was frozen mid-blink. His cat, however,\Nhad several agenda items.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:23.60,Beat,,0,0,0,,THE CAT WOULD LIKE TO CIRCLE BACK.

Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.20,0:00:27.50,Hero,,0,0,0,,ENTER: MOODX
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.80,0:00:32.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then Mina reached for MoodX. Not an engagement score.\NNot a robot judging everyone's face.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.80,0:00:39.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Just one facilitator-controlled cue:\Npart chime, part tiny theatrical intervention.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.00,0:00:45.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ken stopped mid-sentence. The cat sat down.\NThe meeting remembered it had other people in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.60,Beat,,0,0,0,,MIRACLES: NOW AVAILABLE AS A BUTTON.

Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.10,0:00:51.80,Hero,,0,0,0,,QUIET THINK
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.80,0:00:57.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,MoodX protected forty-five seconds, with one question:\Nwhat risk, question, or alternative have we not considered?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.40,0:01:03.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nobody had to perform spontaneity.\NKen bravely survived not speaking.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.20,0:01:09.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yuki wrote. Rob thought. The cat disabled the keyboard.\NA surprisingly strong facilitation technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:11.60,Beat,,0,0,0,,45 SECONDS. KEN'S PERSONAL BEST.

Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.10,0:01:15.50,Hero,,0,0,0,,THERE IT IS.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.40,0:01:20.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yuki shared the risk everyone had missed:\Nthe launch depended on a system going offline tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.60,0:01:26.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ken listened. Mina asked a follow-up.\NRob finally found his unmute button.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.90,0:01:33.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,The decision changed. No rankings. No public scores.\NJust a playful doorway, followed by a useful contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.30,0:01:35.60,Beat,,0,0,0,,USEFUL THOUGHT: SUCCESSFULLY UNMUTED.

Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.10,0:01:39.80,Hero,,0,0,0,,A BETTER MEETING.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.80,0:01:45.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,A better plan, a clear follow-up,\Nand eleven minutes returned to their lives.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.20,0:01:51.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,MoodX did not make everyone louder.\NIt made room for the thought that mattered.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.00,0:01:56.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Fun opened the door. Participation created the value.\NThe cat, naturally, accepted full credit.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.50,0:01:59.90,Hero,,0,0,0,,MOODX
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.50,0:01:59.90,Subhero,,0,0,0,,Make room for more minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:59.90,Disclosure,,0,0,0,,Concept video · AI-generated visuals and synthetic preview narration · Human review required before publication
